{"title":"1998 IMO Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_IMO_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Determine the least possible value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/0/3b078ebefb197590dd33393103b91ba6c0254ff1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1998),$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"65\" height=\"18\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/4/844c71d67a8ebc0ed97120d1405cd2f05c85fe81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f:\\Bbb{N}\\to \\Bbb{N}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"82\" height=\"18\" /> is a function such that for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/0/2f0f67712bb8e44326b3a1e30a316bcaa9884a57.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m,n\\in {\\Bbb N}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"69\" height=\"15\" />, \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/c/2ac108868d9b31654ca95e1ed205902c83a04cf2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f\\left( n^{2}f(m)\\right) =m\\left( f(n)\\right) ^{2}.\\]\" width=\"196\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_IMO_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vOExNCV8jGQ\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vOExNCV8jGQ</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_IMO_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_IMO\" title=\"1998 IMO\">1998 IMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_IMO_Problems\" title=\"1998 IMO Problems\">Problems</a></b>) • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c3222\">Resources</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_IMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1998 IMO Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_IMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1998 IMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_IMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1998 IMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_IMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1998 IMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_IMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1998 IMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_IMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1998 IMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b>Last Question</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=IMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"IMO Problems and Solutions\"> All IMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017191929\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: 